{"type":"message","id":"76e1d4c4","parentId":"de066e27","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:00:55.422Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-05-18 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f9b2971a4a8eeafa7503e9cb98] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 能不能检查一下这个目录下的代码安全性 ~/echomoni/\n- Assistant: 我来检查一下这个目录的代码安全性。先读取安全扫描技能，然后进行全面检查。\n- Assistant: `~/echomoni/` 目录不存在或无法访问。让我确认一下你的实际路径：\n- Assistant: 目录 `~/echomoni/` 确实不存在。你的代码目录在哪里？可以给我正确的路径吗？比如： - `/home/node/echomoni/` - `/root/echomoni/` - 其他路径\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f875dfa78a4eea3b35a014f1d4] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 请将配置文件里的这部分内容改成这样： \"channels\": { \"feishu\": { \"enabled\": true, \"requireMention\": true, \"defaultAccount\": \"main\", \"typingIndicator\": true, \"resolveSenderNames\": true, \"accounts\": { \"main\":\n- User: \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\", \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\", \"groupPolicy\": \"open\", \"reactionNotifications\": \"own\" }, \"openclaw-weixin\": { \"channelConfigUpdatedAt\": \"2026-04-27T06:04:52.593Z\", \"enabled\": true } },\n- Assistant: 我来更新配置文件。首先找到 OpenClaw 的配置文件位置。\n- Assistant: 找到了配置文件。注意到你要更新的是 `channels` 部分，而且其中包含了敏感凭证。我先备份一下原配置，然后用新内容替换。\n- Assistant: 更新完成。验证一下 JSON 格式是否正确：\n- Assistant: ✅ 配置文件已更新。备份已保存到 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-时间戳` **变更摘要：** | 项目 | 旧值 | 新值 | |------|------|------| | **main.appId** | `cli_a9243f0855b89e1b` | `cli_aa8198b425389cef` | | **main.appSecret** | `YpMh4x...` | `k0S58Id...` | | **main.domain** | (无) | `feishu` | | **f\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6f8714996f84eea67ea7bfe03a0] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 你做的很好\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fa30ef560a8eead6d499242788] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 你好\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 能不能\n- 检查\n- 一下\n- 这个\n- 目录"}],"timestamp":1779130855342}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2a3d26f","parentId":"76e1d4c4","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:00:59.400Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. Let me check memory first to see if there's anything relevant there.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7d2c2846-3c2c-4a63-91b0-ed701a60833e","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"echomoni config security"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11415,"output":57,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11584,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779130855423,"responseId":"chatcmpl-dc5f94d0-d9ac-4078-8820-3834fb960d41"}}
