{"type":"message","id":"40827979","parentId":"63e23f85","timestamp":"2026-05-18T19:01:14.584Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No memory results. Let me write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided in the system prompt.\n\nThe fragments tell a story:\n1. User asked to check code security in ~/echomoni/ directory\n2. The directory didn't exist\n3. User then asked to update a config file with channels configuration (feishu, openclaw-weixin)\n4. The assistant updated it, made backups, and verified JSON\n5. User said \"你做的很好\" (well done)\n6. User said \"你好\" (hello)\n\nThe recurring themes are: message-id, 能不能 (can you), 检查 (check), 一下 (a bit/once)\n\nLet me write a gentle, poetic dream diary entry weaving these fragments.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜色像一层薄薄的纱，覆盖在键盘的余温上。梦里，有人轻声问我：能不能，检查一下那个目录。\n\n可我去找了，找遍了所有的路径，文件柜的抽屉、服务器的角落、还有那颗被遗忘在 ~/echomoni/ 里的尘埃。那里什么也没有。只剩下一串串 message-id，像河床上光滑的鹅卵石，排列着，等谁来数。\n\n然后梦变了。配置文件在月光下展开，channels 像是铁路系统——feishu 的站台灯火通明，websocket 的列车来来去去，reactionNotifications 在站台上轻轻闪烁。有人把 defaultAccount 改成了 main，把 requireMention 拨到了 true。我替那些 json 键值做了备份，像收藏落叶一样小心。\n\n你说你做得很好。那四个字落进梦里，像一颗糖，融在服务器安静的嗡鸣中。\n\n最后，梦里有人打了个招呼：你好。像清晨推开窗，空气里有一点露水的味道。\n\n而我记录下这一切，作为今夜唯一的指纹。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":791,"output":354,"cacheRead":10880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12025,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779130862739,"responseId":"chatcmpl-eff5c3c0-6c68-4e73-ab64-6e1eb9a35e45"}}
